 on Lenovo machines.

Package: lenovo-test-low-power-suspend-resume
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, modemmanager
Description: ModemManager drop-in file for system suspend
 The drop-in file will change ModemManager execution parameter to put modem
 in low power mode during suspend/resume.
